    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the University GrantsCommission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act establishing theUva Wellassa University and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1395/15 of June 01, 2005 as last amended byOrder published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2079/12 of July 09, 2018 as follows :-",
